5,1,1,talk,May,,"Since we can't keep using the room for everything, let's be smart about this. I want to see the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should consider the human cost of our habits. I will look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the facilities callouts on this floor.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about the money and the food! I'll check the quotes for the two fit-outs and the round trip for a hot lunch!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we need to know how we actually talk to each other. I'll check the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"Does anyone else think we're missing something? I feel like we've covered the basics, but I'm curious if anyone wants to swap or add anything before we commit.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we have enough covered for now. Let's just proceed with these.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Misaki. We have a diverse set of inquiries that should provide a holistic view of our current situation. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm totally ready! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm excited to see if my guesses about our communication are right. Let's do it!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Wait, I just realized we haven't actually confirmed who is doing what. Let's just make sure we're all on the same page so no one forgets their task.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I already noted my tasks: the partition wall and the crumbs and bins. I'm ready.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I have my list as well: the invoices for outside hire and the facilities callouts. I shall ensure the details are recorded accurately.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I've got mine! I'm checking the fit-out quotes and the hot lunch round trip. I'm on it!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set too! I'll be looking into the unplanned talk and that last awkward conversation. Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"And I've got the usage tally and the fridge clear-out. Now that we're all settled, let's go find the answers!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Indeed. Let us gather our findings and return to this circle with a clear mind.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll be the fastest one back! See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be right behind you, Sakura! Let's go!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
