35,2,1,talk,May,,"It turns out a couple of people are using that room way more than the rest of us, and the fridge situation was a total mess.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is basically paper; you can hear everything. Also, people are eating at their desks, and it's getting messy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found that we have spent a significant amount on outside room rentals for very small groups, and our internal facilities requests have been quite low.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The quotes for the fit-outs are actually pretty different, and wow, it takes forever to get a hot lunch from the nearest place!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"It's even worse than I thought. We barely talk unless it's by the printer, and the last time something tough had to be said, it happened right in front of everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if people are already eating at their desks and making a mess, maybe we should actually give them a proper place to do it?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"That might solve the mess at the desks, but if the walls are that thin, a noisy kitchen right next to us could be even worse.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,We must also consider the financial drain of those outside rentals. It seems we are paying for a space we could potentially create ourselves.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Exactly! And since it takes so long to get lunch, having a kitchen would be a huge time-saver for everyone!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"But if we just make it a kitchen, will we still have a place for those awkward or private talks? We can't just keep talking by the printer.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, a kitchen is a social hub! People might actually start talking more if they're gathering for coffee or lunch instead of just hiding at their desks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not so sure. A social hub is usually a loud hub, and as I said, the sound travels right through the wall to where we work.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Perhaps a middle ground exists. If we create a dedicated space for discussions, we solve the rental costs and the privacy issue, though it does not address the hunger.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"But a meeting room sounds so boring! If we have a kitchen, we can have snacks and be happy, and that makes people want to talk more, right?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I don't think snacks are enough to fix the problem. We need a place where we can actually have a private conversation without the whole office listening in.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"I think we're overthinking the noise. If we have a proper system for the room, we can manage the mess and the volume while finally stopping the desk-crumbs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not convinced. If the wall is that thin, any ""system"" for noise will be ignored the moment someone gets excited or loud.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must weigh the immediate convenience of food against the long-term necessity of a professional and private space for our interactions.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,But we're already paying for outside rooms! Why not just spend that money on making our own room awesome so we don't have to leave the building?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"That's a great point, Sakura, but ""awesome"" should mean we can actually talk to each other properly, not just have a place to eat.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
